  "notable_quotes": [
    "The framework contains larger channels with 11 × 5.5 Å2 windows, but these channels are occupied by (CH3)2NH2+ cations and water molecules.",
    "In compound 1, trz ligands build 2D Zn-triazolate layers from trinuclear Zn3(trz)6 clusters, and oxalate pillars extend them into a 3D network.",
